S,GL2PointCounts,"Sequence of Fp-point counts on X_H/Fp for p >= B0 not dividing N up to B. If PrimePowers is set each entry is a list of integers giving point counts over Fq for q=p,p^2,...<= B. If ZeroFill is set the returned array will have an entry for every prime p in [B0,B] with zeros or empty lists inserted at bad primes",0,2,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,RngIntElt,,0,0,GrpMat,,SeqEnum,Null,Null,Null,Null,Null
